  "description": "TableReader.ClosedXML is a .NET library that provides a simple and efficient way to read tabular data from Excel files using the ClosedXML library.\nIt enables developers to extract tables, rows, and columns from specified worksheets, supporting flexible range selection and robust error handling.\nThis package is ideal for applications that require reliable Excel data import functionality without the need for Microsoft Office interop.\nTargeting .NET 8, TableReader.ClosedXML is suitable for modern .NET applications and services.",
